# MemPalace defensive guard. The bootstrap script (scripts/install-mempalace.sh)
# deliberately does NOT run `mempalace init` against the repo root because per
# upstream issue MemPalace/mempalace#185, `init <dir>` writes these two files
# into <dir>. If a contributor runs `mempalace init .` in the repo root
# anyway, these patterns keep the checkout clean. The palace database itself
# lives at ~/.mempalace/ (per-user, NOT committed).
/entities.json
/mempalace.yaml
